<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jun 16 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper down 1875, tin up 125, lead unchanged, zinc unchanged, aluminium down 3850, nickel down 264, aluminium alloy down 360</p>
